    {
      "tag": "aragonese_union",
      "layer": "dynastic_legitimacy",
      "description": "The union of Aragon and Barcelona under Ramón Berenguer IV (1137) gradually subordinated the county's identity within the larger Crown of Aragon; Castilian dominance after 1479 further marginalized the Catalan commercial tradition",
