      "tag": "crown_of_aragon_subordination",
      "direction": "decline",
      "description": "After the union with Aragon, Barcelona gradually lost political autonomy. Aragonese territorial policy often conflicted with Catalan commercial interests; repeated feudal conflicts between Catalan cities and the crown eroded the county's independent standing.",
